/scratchpad/

# agent tool caches — but project-scoped agent skills, settings, and agent/hook
# definitions are versioned on purpose (PO decision 2026-09-04, extended
# 2026-09-04): `.claude/*` ignores worktrees, local settings and caches, and
# the negations below re-include only `.claude/skills/`, `.claude/settings.json`
# (verified secret-free: `enabledPlugins` + a `permissions.allow` command
# allowlist, nothing else), `.claude/agents/` and `.claude/hooks/`.
# `.claude/settings.local.json` (session-specific paths), `.claude/worktrees/`
# (full worktree checkouts), `.claude/scratch/` and `.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock`
# stay ignored on purpose — none of those are meant to leave this machine.
.atl/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/hooks/

# design handoff reference (local only — source for the Libreta Nacional redesign, not production)
design_handoff_*/
install.cmd

